{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"> Divide your ad budget by the number of impressions, and then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 by 1,000 impressions gives you a CPM of $10. The currency is whatever you spent for the budget.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"cpm-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["cpm-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"> Ibahagi ang badyet ng ad sa bilang ng mga impression, at pagkatapos ay paramihin ng ZXQPH0000QXZ. Halimbawa, ang $ZXQPH0001QXZ sa mga impression na ZXQPH0002QXZ ay nagbibigay ng CPM na $ZXQPH0003QXZ. Ang pera ay kung ano man ang ginamit mo para sa badyet.","record_id":"f91830476d1dc59bea2aa219c1f15ab961d559671540451f2fbdafeb540592ab","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.3372167408750073,"source":"Divide the ad spend by the number of impressions, then multiply by 1,000. For example, $10 over 1,000 impressions gives a CPM of $10. The currency is whatever you used for spend.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"c14434161a5361c1ae7b3ae1ac78be90ef1a6cb394b485d83f55558fad116f25","status":"machine-draft","translation":"> Ibahagi ang badyet ng ad sa bilang ng mga impression, at pagkatapos ay paramihin ng 1,000. Halimbawa, ang $10 sa mga impression na 1,000 ay nagbibigay ng CPM na $10. Ang pera ay kung ano man ang ginamit mo para sa badyet.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
